# This repository publishes part of a larger working folder, so everything is
# ignored by default and the files and folders that are published are named one
# by one below. A new file in the working folder therefore cannot be committed
# by accident: it has to be added to this list first.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENCES.md
!/LICENCE-MIT.txt
!/CITATION.cff

!/analysis/
!/data/
!/prereg/
!/public/
!/scripts/
!/tools/

# Clutter, at any depth inside the folders above.
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Two scripts belong to the writing of the article rather than to the study, and
# the repository publishes the study. They make the Word review copies of a draft
# and read the author's comments back out of them.
/scripts/make_review_copy.py
/scripts/extract_review_comments.py
